fh1-reimagined-arm64 builds Forza Horizon 1: ReImagined
(https://github.com/FH1-ReImagined/ForzaHorizon1-ReImagined, GPL-3.0-or-later with the
additional permission in its NOTICE.md) and its SDK ReIGlue
(https://github.com/FH1-ReImagined/ReIGlue, BSD-3-Clause) for linux-arm64. The patches in
this repository modify those projects and are released under the same licenses: patches/game
under GPL-3.0-or-later, patches/sdk under BSD-3-Clause.

